        "datePublic": "2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z",
        "title": "FreeRDP shadow before 3.32.0 Pre-Authentication Input Injection via Confirm Active bypass",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "FreeRDP shadow server from 3.0.0 before 3.32.0 dispatches input PDUs during the Confirm Active state before authentication, allowing unauthenticated attackers to inject keyboard input. Attackers can negotiate TLS-only RDP and send an input PDU without Confirm Active to inject synthetic keystrokes into the host user's X11 session via XTEST."
          }
        ],
        "problemTypes": [
          {
            "descriptions": [
              {
